### 0. Login as admin and customer
# @name loginAdmin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@gmail.com",
  "password": "abc12345"
}

###

# @name loginCustomer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "farah@gmail.com",
  "password": "abc12345"
}

###

### 1. Create two events with different prices
# @name eventA
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Report Test A",
  "description": "test",
  "category": "Tech",
  "eventDate": "2026-09-15T18:00:00",
  "venue": "Hall A",
  "capacity": 20,
  "price": 50
}

###

# @name eventB
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Report Test B",
  "description": "test",
  "category": "Music",
  "eventDate": "2026-09-20T18:00:00",
  "venue": "Hall B",
  "capacity": 20,
  "price": 100
}

###

### 2. Book seats on both events
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCustomer.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "{{eventA.response.body.$.id}}",
  "seatsRequested": 3
}

###

# @name bookingB
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCustomer.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "{{eventB.response.body.$.id}}",
  "seatsRequested": 2
}

###

### 3. Cancel the booking on event B - it must disappear from the reports' counts
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/{{bookingB.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCustomer.response.body.$.token}}

###

### 4. Bookings-per-event as admin -> expect only Event A: totalBookings=1, totalSeatsBooked=3
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/bookings-per-event
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}

###

### 5. Revenue-per-event as admin -> expect only Event A: revenue=150 (3 seats x 50)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/revenue-per-event
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}

###

### 6. Customer tries to view reports -> expect 403
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/bookings-per-event
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCustomer.response.body.$.token}}